abstract: >-
  This package serves as an installable template to adapt
  the automation framework consisting of LabScheduler,
  Laborchestrator, PythonLab, PlatformStatusDataBase and
  some SiLA-Servers to a new robotic lab. It also contains
  out of the box running demo examples.
